{"3917010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CRACKED", "steam_appid": 3917010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917010/extras/b87d02a24472c481cd1143d22c6555b3.poster.avif?t=1767817133\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917010/extras/b87d02a24472c481cd1143d22c6555b3.webm?t=1767817133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917010/extras/b87d02a24472c481cd1143d22c6555b3.mp4?t=1767817133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRACKED</strong> is a fast-paced, 3D PvP roguelike where glass-headed mages go head-to-head (or head-to-shards) in chaotic arena duels. Inspired by <i>Rounds</i> and powered by physics-based combat, every fight is unpredictable, explosive, and wildly replayable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up in 1v1 all the way to 4v4 showdowns. After every round, choose from a pool of powerful, quirky upgrades that stack into outrageous builds — from homing fireballs and jet packs to rapid-fire chaos or poison clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two fights are the same. No glass head survives forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917010/extras/c46f60e11c8d52bdd83a4d6741e7861c.poster.avif?t=1767817133\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917010/extras/c46f60e11c8d52bdd83a4d6741e7861c.webm?t=1767817133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917010/extras/c46f60e11c8d52bdd83a4d6741e7861c.mp4?t=1767817133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔮 <strong>Team-based Brawling:</strong> Battle it out in 1v1 all the way to 4v4 matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠<strong> Make your build:</strong> with over 40 upgrades of various rarities, make your build your own!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧪 <strong>Concoct your fun:</strong> Stack upgrades each round and create broken, over-the-top combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ <strong>Fast &amp; Fluid Rounds:</strong> Jump into short, explosive matches with zero downtime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Controller &amp; Online Ready:</strong> Built for online competitive fun.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917010/extras/d0dcad2a4e2d01d0274fed5f17c1f7a2.poster.avif?t=1767817133\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917010/extras/d0dcad2a4e2d01d0274fed5f17c1f7a2.webm?t=1767817133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917010/extras/d0dcad2a4e2d01d0274fed5f17c1f7a2.mp4?t=1767817133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917010/extras/b87d02a24472c481cd1143d22c6555b3.poster.avif?t=1767817133\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917010/extras/b87d02a24472c481cd1143d22c6555b3.webm?t=1767817133\" type=\"video/webm; code